# State: the Sample gallery shows the group whose nav item is `nav`.
# Vars: nav (default OverlaysNavItem) = a gallery nav item id: FoundationsNavItem, ActionsNavItem, InputsNavItem,
#       QuantitiesNavItem, ConventionsNavItem, CollectionsNavItem, CardsNavItem, SectionsNavItem, ProgressNavItem,
#       NavigationNavItem, FeedbackNavItem, OverlaysNavItem or ChromeNavItem.
# Passive-safe: no `key` steps.
#
#   run lib/sample-goto-page nav=OverlaysNavItem
#   pwsh -NoProfile -WorkingDirectory geodc -File dev/ui.ps1 do --target sample --file dev/ui-scripts/lib/sample-goto-page.ui --var nav=OverlaysNavItem
@target sample
@var nav=OverlaysNavItem

click --id ${nav}
wait --id ${nav} --selected
assert --id ${nav} --selected
